     ". The number type of Nii file can be \"Integer\", \"Real\", \
\"Complex\", or \"Automatic\"."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"10c8bf71-e663-6a4a-b8a6-375f49970523"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "46bf997d-b08d-244a-bd53-8c0226628e8c"], 
    ButtonBox["CompressNii",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsNiftiTools/ref/CompressNii"], 
    ButtonBox["True",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     "CompressNii is an option for DcmToNii and ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "ExportNii"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "5bb0a4a9-d48b-ac41-a17e-7bfeacabbecb"],
     ". If set ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["True",
       BaseStyle->"Link"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "6c7919a9-0869-a24d-a21d-5066873c411c"],
     " .nii.gz files will be created."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"3eaf0eee-b84f-f042-b6b5-fefa7e4d82de"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "cefd4c71-410d-e648-8625-a402fecdb051"], 
    ButtonBox["NiiOffset",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsNiftiTools/ref/NiiOffset"], 
    ButtonBox["Automatic",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     "NiiOffset is an option of ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "ExportNii"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "d368712b-c6cd-394c-a7c3-8f40e68a1317"],
     ". Is {xOff, yOff, zOff}."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"df3a7735-7909-bc49-b32f-13db7bd8eccc"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "460792f5-8d1a-8b4c-821a-035164bca6f5"], 
    ButtonBox["NiiLegacy",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsNiftiTools/ref/NiiLegacy"], 
